<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Stokes raises Seven stake to 24 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Stokes raises Seven stake to 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven Network Ltd chairman Kerry Stokes said in a substantial shareholding notice to the Australian Stock Exchange that he had increased his stake Seven Network to 24.085 percent from 21.98 percent.</p>
</text>
